{"id": "31623", "title": "清忠谱", "author": "李玉", "category": "文学名著", "count": 26, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/31/31623.htm", "intro": "中国明末清初传奇作品。李玉著。反映明代天启年间阉党魏忠贤等人对东林党人的迫害史实，成功地塑造了颜佩韦等“五人义”的市民形象，他们舍生仗义，毫不畏惧，可歌可泣，与胆小怕事、迂腐可笑的请愿书生形成鲜明对照。特别是剧中描绘了广大人民群众积极参与抗争的场面，在舞台上展示了市民暴动的壮烈景象。这在中国戏曲史上尚属首创。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31623", "chapters": [{"title": "第 一 折", "file": "2043857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 二 折", "file": "2043858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 三 折", "file": "2043859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 四 折", "file": "2043860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 五 折", "file": "2043861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 六 折", "file": "2043862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 七 折", "file": "2043863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 八 折", "file": "2043864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 九 折", "file": "2043865.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十 折", "file": "2043866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一折", "file": "2043867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二折", "file": "2043868.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三折", "file": "2043869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四折", "file": "2043870.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五折", "file": "2043871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六折", "file": "2043872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七折", "file": "2043873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八折", "file": "2043874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九折", "file": "2043875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十折", "file": "2043876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿一折", "file": "2043877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿二折", "file": "2043878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿三折", "file": "2043879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿四折", "file": "2043880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿五折", "file": "2043881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "后　记", "file"